# Quantum Living Solutions - Environment Variables Classification Policy

# 1. PRIVATE SECRETS (Must NEVER use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix)
# - Exclusively accessible on the server runtime.
# - Checked in Git: NEVER.
# - Managed via serverless hosting settings.
# Examples:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:port/dbname
# JWT_SECRET=opaque_base64_signing_key_32_bytes
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=razorpay_secret_signature_key

# 2. PUBLIC CONFIGURATION (Must use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix)
# - Visible in client browser bundles.
# - Checked in Git: Only if safe for repository viewers.
# Examples:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://quantumlivingsolutions.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_live_public_key_identifier
